subject_pose_decoder.lua is derived from Epic-LUT/src/preview/player_authored_clip.lua
at revision 9d4f69e9a67f68124cf2b3aeb50425eab797e57e.
Upstream SHA-256: 268e6e3629c2c9dd6d2aca8f0a9b90d4bfbccaa5ab9efb942cca23ef817783a0.
Local adjustment: ignored subtype-2 event markers may have bounded timestamps
outside a trimmed clip's duration; bone transform keys remain duration-bound.
This follows the pinned SDK's separate treatment of event marker records.
Only the offline generator imports this decoder; the runtime uses sampled pose data.
